      "width": 380,
      "height": 380,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## Boundary 定义\n\n**axis 3 = ✗ (no annotated image)**\n\n排除 3 image-on phantom corners:\n• #2 DOM-prompt + AXTree + image\n• #4 (mismatched) + image\n• #6 P-text + image\n\n→ image embedding tax 拉齐 SoM\n→ 失去 4-fold drop-in\n→ violate phantom space\n\n**Boundary ≠ matched parsing** (旧 framing 已 retract)"
    },
    {
      "id": "234567890abcdef1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1400,
      "y": 80,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 380,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "## 4-fold drop-in property\n\n4 phantom corners 共享 *by construction*:\n\n**(a) cost ≈ DOM**\n     no image embedding tax\n\n**(b) latency ~50% lower**\n     no image inference (cls 4×)\n\n**(c) signal AUROC ≥ baseline** ✅\n     5/5 phantom usable, red P-text 0.793 = 5-mode max\n\n**(d) drop-one oracle 1.7-3.8pp** ✅\n     B0 red: P-text +3.81 / P-SoM +3.33 / P-prompt +2.86\n     CI 全 exclude 0\n\n(a)(b) definitional\n(c)(d) emergent (实证)"
    },
    {
      "id": "34567890abcdef12",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1400,
      "y": 500,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 240,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "## Zoom 1 deductive argument\n\nphantom comparison 锁 image=✗\n→ input 仅剩 (prompt + obs 文本)\n→ 任何 differential 必由这两 input 差异 trigger\n→ **M1 + M2 by construction exhaustive**\n\n即使跑 100 个 phantom corners 也不能反驳 — phantom space 内**无 hidden 3rd axis**"
    }
  ],
